YachtBazar catalog data — attribution and licensing
===================================================

This archive contains listings.js / listings.json (a marina, dock and boat
catalog compiled by YachtBazar, https://yachtbazar.com) and data.db.

Records in this catalog come from several sources with different licences.
Each record carries a "source" field, and marina records additionally carry an
"import_src" field, identifying where that record came from.


OpenStreetMap-derived records
-----------------------------
Records with "source": "osm", and records marked "import_src": "osm-delta",
are derived from OpenStreetMap.

    Data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database
    License (ODbL) 1.0.
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The full text of the ODbL 1.0 is included in this archive as ODbL-1.0.txt.

These records, and any database derived from them, are distributed under the
ODbL 1.0. Each OpenStreetMap-derived record retains a link to its OpenStreetMap
object so the upstream feature can be identified. City values on these records
were produced by reverse geocoding with OpenStreetMap's Nominatim service.


Overture Maps Foundation records
--------------------------------
Records marked "import_src": "overture" are derived from the Places theme
published by the Overture Maps Foundation, https://overturemaps.org
(accessed 2026-07-29).

Overture licenses Places records according to their original source:

  - Community Data License Agreement - Permissive, Version 2.0
    (CDLA-Permissive-2.0) for records sourced from Meta, Microsoft, PinMeTo,
    Krick, RenderSEO, DAC and BrightQuery. Full text included in this archive
    as CDLA-Permissive-2.0.txt.

  - Apache License, Version 2.0 for records sourced from Foursquare —
    Copyright 2024 Foursquare Labs, Inc. Full text included in this archive
    as Apache-2.0.txt.

  - CC0 1.0 for records sourced from AllThePlaces.

Our import did not retain Overture's per-record source and licence markers, so
we cannot identify which individual records fall under which of the above.
All applicable licence texts are therefore included, and all three should be
treated as potentially applying to any Overture-derived record.

CHANGED: these records have been modified by YachtBazar. Fields were selected,
reformatted and normalised, and merged with records from other sources; not all
original fields are retained.


Marina operator records
-----------------------
Facts on marina records — phone numbers, slip counts, fuel availability, hours
and amenities — were gathered from each marina's own public website. These are
factual details and carry no licence, but the source page and verification date
were recorded for each. Marina operators who want a correction or removal can
reach us at https://yachtbazar.com/contact

By-owner listings
-----------------
Boat, dock and slip records from public by-owner sources (for example
Craigslist and Facebook Marketplace) were publicly posted by their owners, and
each retains a link back to the original post. Records posted directly on
YachtBazar by their owners are marked as such.


Machine-readable copy (ODbL section 4.6)
----------------------------------------
The catalog is offered in machine-readable form at:
https://github.com/goldexchangev-hash/yachtbazar-data/releases/tag/v1


Note on scope
-------------
Nothing in YachtBazar's Terms of Service is intended to restrict rights you
hold in the third-party data above under the licences named here.
